Bind Zone 21
Quest 500 "Rescuing Sid / Rescuing Michelle"
    Journal "I promised to hunt Worm outside the village to rescue a human."
    Kill 1 of 700, 701, 750, 751

Requires player level >= 1
Auto accept

On started
    Say "Help! Someone help me!\nA human has been eaten by the Worm outside the village"

On ready
    If player is karus
        Say "Growl..Growl...."
        Topic "You OK, kid?" do
            Complete quest
            Say "Gasp... I almost died... If you were going to rescue me, you should have come earlier. I almost croaked."
    Else
        Say "Growl..Growl...."
        Topic "Pummel to death" do
            Complete quest
            Say "Gasp... I almost died... If you were going to rescue me, you should have come earlier. I almost croaked."
